Package: genesys-gui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, genesys-web (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Generic and Expansible System Simulator Qt GUI
 GenESyS is a C++ simulation platform designed as an extensible
 architecture for modeling and simulation.
 .
 This package provides the Qt desktop graphical user interface.

Package: genesys-web
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Generic and Expansible System Simulator web application
 GenESyS is a C++ simulation platform designed as an extensible
 architecture for modeling and simulation.
 .
